      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "well for them to fix there overall issues with code offloading and optimisation, they would practically need to rebuild the game from the base code, which will take a significant amount of time and money to fix, plus all those labour hours to get it gong again.\nPlus unity itself typically likes to keep many things on one single thread so thats why its difficult to offload some due to engine itself, and you have to do some voodoo magic to get to do muti-threading properly.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
