      "value": "@{5fd2046bdc44a742982b8dcd|full_name}: It just seems like the main thread is always stuck waiting or something or my system's just too fast which shouldn't be the case. I honestly don't know what is causing it.\nI've already tried swapping USB ports, making sure drivers, firmware, etc are updated, checking windows power management, etc. I've reinstalled VRC aswell. I'm about to do a clean GPU driver installation incase of a driver corruption to see if that solves anything.",
